Behaal hai bechain hai ghabrayi hai Zainab,<br>
Shabbir ko dafna ke watan aayi hai Zainab.<br>
<br>
Chillati hai Saidaaniyaa sab qabre Nabi par,<br>
Sughra ko kaleje se jo laptayi hai Zainab.<br>
<br>
Kehti hai kabhi qabre Payambar se wo rokar,<br>
Majaye Hussaina ki yeh majayi hai Zainab.<br>
<br>
Turbat pe chadane ke liye bhai ka kurta,<br>
Soughat yeh nana ke liye layi hai Zainab.<br>
<br>
Pehchan nahi sakte jise ahle mohalla,<br>
Itna Shahe mazloom ka gham khayi hai Zainab.<br>
<br>
Gar aah koi karta toh ro deti hai khud bhi,<br>
Ho jiski na tafseel woh dukh payi hai Zainab.<br>
<br>
Dil chak toh maghmoom ka chalni hai kaleja,<br>
Woh nashtare gham haye sitam khayi hai Zainab.<br>
<br>
Samjhate hai Sajjad karo sabr phuphi jaa'n,<br>
Ghar aayi hai lekin abhi ghabrayi hai Zainab.<br>
<br>
Har saans se aati hai sada haye Hussaina,<br>
'Hilmi' Shahe mazloom ki majayi hai Zainab...